{"ID":"20240506110124-to5e0rx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506110124-to5e0rx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110124-to5e0rx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506110124-u31fyjx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613175403-bv10zzx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2955\u0026#125;","title":"345蜣螂","type":"doc","updated":"20240828092227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240703135212-cv8bsjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703135212-cv8bsjd","updated":"20240828091927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 481px;","style":"width: 471px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂7-20240703135212-qqwx7zp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 471px;\" parent-style=\"width: 481px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703134723-ouc4k9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703134723-ouc4k9w","updated":"20240828092109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 480px;","style":"width: 470px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂1-20240703134723-sn70c9v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 470px;\" parent-style=\"width: 480px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 413px;","style":"width: 403px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂-20240828092109-sowsw3g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 403px;\" parent-style=\"width: 413px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703135458-09goxkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703135458-09goxkm","updated":"20240828092118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂4-20240703134932-k1j7eih.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 532px;","style":"width: 522px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂10"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂10-20240703135545-w9zxhqk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 522px;\" parent-style=\"width: 532px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240703134753-tbpsaso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703134753-tbpsaso","updated":"20240828092206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂2-20240703134753-x32bw5l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂 1-20240828092206-e3kvuxi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703135136-iminrsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703135136-iminrsn","updated":"20240828092219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂6-20240703135136-gbkzst9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 571px;","style":"width: 561px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂8-20240703135343-hgcjswq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 561px;\" parent-style=\"width: 571px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240703135034-6vxtx8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703135034-6vxtx8r","updated":"20240703135039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜣螂幼虫"}]},{"ID":"20240703135029-vfx4l9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703135029-vfx4l9t","updated":"20240828092227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 498px;","style":"width: 488px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂9-20240703135439-wdqfy7q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 488px;\" parent-style=\"width: 498px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜣螂5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜣螂5-20240703135029-m4cvn0z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-0xhx09c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-0xhx09c","updated":"20240703134825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为屎壳郎。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-zy23ral","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-zy23ral"}},{"ID":"20240613175543-ajqexs1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175543-ajqexs1","updated":"20240613175547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175543-atkp3me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175543-atkp3me","updated":"20240613175543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175543-cmryk8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175543-cmryk8d","updated":"20240613175543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主小儿惊痫，瘈疭，腹张，寒热，大人瘨疾狂易。一名蛣蜣。火熬之良。生池泽。《名医》曰：生长沙，五月五日取，蒸藏之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175543-7hypw4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175543-7hypw4z","updated":"20240613175543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：（虫郄），渠（虫郄），一曰天杜。《广雅》云：天杜，蜣螂也。《尔雅》云：蛣蜣，蜣螂，郭璞云：黑甲虫，啖粪土，玉篇，蜣螂同，《说文》无蜣字，渠，即蛣蜣，音之缓急。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-qlcdw6s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-qlcdw6s"}},{"ID":"20240613175533-ua2kfpj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175533-ua2kfpj","updated":"20240613175537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175533-blz7pme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175533-blz7pme","updated":"20240613175533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主小儿惊痫，螈 ，腹胀，寒热，大人癫疾狂易。手足端寒，肢满贲豚。一名 蜣。火熬之良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175533-rgw8b74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175533-rgw8b74","updated":"20240613175533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生长沙池泽。五月五日取，蒸，藏之，临用当炙，勿置水中，令人吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175533-qgo4ng1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175533-qgo4ng1","updated":"20240613175533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏羊角、石膏。庄子云∶ 蜣之智，在于转丸。其喜入人粪中，取屎丸而却推之，俗名推丸。当取大者，其类有三、四种，以鼻头扁者为真。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175533-deoh769","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175533-deoh769","updated":"20240613175723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《别录》云∶捣为丸，塞下部，引痔虫出尽，永瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175644-va8bf6t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175644-va8bf6t"}},{"ID":"20240613175645-ncahj2y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-ncahj2y","updated":"20240613175649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175645-6w3nm1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-6w3nm1j","updated":"20240613175645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒，味酸。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175645-l7rv0kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-l7rv0kx","updated":"20240613175645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶治小儿惊风螈 ，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂易。手足端寒，支满奔豚。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175645-0ap6pkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-0ap6pkx","updated":"20240613175645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《日华子》云∶堕胎，治疰忤。和干姜，傅恶疮，出箭头。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175645-ph4poh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-ph4poh4","updated":"20240613175645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《图经》云∶心，主疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175645-ovo4b5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175645-ovo4b5b","updated":"20240613175645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《衍义》云∶大小二种。一种大者，为胡蜣螂，身黑光，腹翼下有小黄子，附母飞行，昼不出，夜方飞至人家户庭中，见灯光则来；一种小者，身黑暗，昼方飞出，夜不出。今当用胡蜣螂，以其小者，研三十枚，以水灌牛、马肠结，佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175728-7uduauj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175728-7uduauj"}},{"ID":"20240613175729-fx5acq1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175729-fx5acq1","updated":"20240613175738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175729-6nz3oi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175729-6nz3oi7","updated":"20240613175729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒，有毒。去足，火炙用。勿置水中，令人吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175729-xvedjh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175729-xvedjh3","updated":"20240613175729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主小儿惊痫瘛疭，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175729-5pw1ttz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175729-5pw1ttz","updated":"20240613175729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔发明〕蜣螂，手足阳明、足厥阴药也。《本经》等治，总不离三经之证。其治暴噎、吐食，用二枚入生姜内煨，以陈橘皮二钱同巴豆炒过，去巴豆，将蜣螂、陈皮为末，每服二分，吹入喉中，吐痰二三次即愈。又治箭镞入骨，用巴豆微炒，同蜣螂捣涂，痛定必痒，忍之，待急痒不可忍乃撼动拔之。又烧灰入冰片少许，治大肠脱肛，掺上托入，捣丸塞下部，引痔虫出尽，永瘥。其蜣螂心贴疔疮拔疔，贴半日许，血尽根出则愈。然蜣螂最畏羊肉，食之即发。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175705-j2drurn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175705-j2drurn"}},{"ID":"20240613175707-pwtktuf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175707-pwtktuf","updated":"20240613175720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175707-0h9r4g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175707-0h9r4g6","updated":"20240613175707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒。主治手足端寒，肢满贲豚。生长沙。五月五日取，蒸，藏之。临用当炙。勿置水中。令人吐。（畏羊角、石膏。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175707-aks48ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175707-aks48ms","updated":"20240613175707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又，捣为丸，塞下部，引痔虫出尽，永瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175707-5kty3vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175707-5kty3vj","updated":"20240613175707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：蜣螂，味咸，寒。主小儿惊痫瘛疭，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂易。一名蛣蜣。火熬之良。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175654-n0dackc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175654-n0dackc"}},{"ID":"20240613175655-5owqpnq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175655-5owqpnq","updated":"20240613175700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175655-weznmtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175655-weznmtp","updated":"20240613175655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。主小儿惊痫螈。腹胀寒热。大人疾狂易。一名蜣。火熬之良。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175655-vaimyl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175655-vaimyl0","updated":"20240613175655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深睛昂鼻。附母飞行。圆催丸转。光扑灯明。久谙饱秽。忽化饥清。野狐觅食。暗听钟声。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175655-4hjine1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175655-4hjine1","updated":"20240613175655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"韩保升曰。此类多种。以鼻高目深者入药。庄子。蜣之智。在于转丸。陶弘景曰。俗名推丸。寇宗曰。腹翼有小黄。子附母而飞。昼伏夜出。见灯光则来。狐喜食之。抱朴子曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175655-a63jiak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175655-a63jiak","updated":"20240613175655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸣蝉洁饥。不羡蜣螂秽饱。李时珍曰。柞蝉有转丸化成者。苏轼诗。洪钟起暗室。能作殷床声。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175633-y6ltaxz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175633-y6ltaxz"}},{"ID":"20240613175634-vadvg2t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175634-vadvg2t","updated":"20240613175638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175634-j230uu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175634-j230uu3","updated":"20240613175634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主治小儿惊痫，螈 ，腹胀，寒热，大人癫疾，狂易。手足端寒，肢满贲豚。一名 蜣。火熬之良。生长沙池泽。五月五日取，蒸，藏之，临用当炙，勿置水中，令人吐。（畏羊角、石膏。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175634-w6wnoo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175634-w6wnoo2","updated":"20240613175634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"庄子云∶ 蜣之智，在于转丸。其喜入人粪中，取屎丸而却推之，俗名推丸。当取大者，其类有三四种，以鼻头扁者为真。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175618-lmgep0v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175618-lmgep0v"}},{"ID":"20240613175620-3h7miql","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175620-3h7miql","updated":"20240613175625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175620-zkktei8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175620-zkktei8","updated":"20240613175620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味咸寒。主小儿惊痫，瘈疭，腹张，寒热，大人瘨疾狂易。一名蛣蜣。火熬之良。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175620-79jh7x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175620-79jh7x4","updated":"20240613175620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，微寒，入足厥阴肝经。善破癥瘕，能开燥结。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175620-q3m5uiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175620-q3m5uiv","updated":"20240613175620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鳖甲煎丸"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在鳖甲。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治病疟日久，结为癥瘕，以其破癥而开结也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175620-fqd0c73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175620-fqd0c73","updated":"20240613175620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒枯存性，研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175551-8tm1z35","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175551-8tm1z35"}},{"ID":"20240613175553-eskdob9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175553-eskdob9","updated":"20240613175558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175553-pcyew2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175553-pcyew2u","updated":"20240613175553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏石膏、羊角、羊肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175553-09hhej3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175553-09hhej3","updated":"20240613175553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸、寒。有毒。入足厥阴经。治惊痫，散风热，疗下痢，破畜血，敷疔毒，消重舌。配巴豆，炒敷箭头入骨，待痒极拔之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175553-s8vhshq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175553-s8vhshq","updated":"20240613175553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蒸炒，去足、翅用。勿置水中，以使人吐。其性猛急，最易伤脾，勿轻用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175553-8si74z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175553-8si74z9","updated":"20240613175553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗呼推车客。以土包粪，能转而成丸，山上颇多。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175604-cy9qmss","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175604-cy9qmss"}},{"ID":"20240613175605-6u7ftih","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175605-6u7ftih","updated":"20240613175612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175605-prsejam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175605-prsejam","updated":"20240613175605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒有毒，肝胃双行，便闭虫疳，肠积能攻痫疾愈，惊风痔漏，疮疡并治骨疽消，拔箭镞之灾伤，贴疔毒而病愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175605-mhakbrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175605-mhakbrz","updated":"20240613175605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蜣螂一名推车虫，即攻屎虫也，喜入粪土中，以屎推成丸，雄曳雌推，置于坎中，覆之而去，数日即有小蜣螂出于中，此亦物类所感耳，味咸性寒，有小毒，入肝胃大小肠，治惊痫者，皆由风热客于经络，蜣螂蠕动之物，以风胜则动，故能治风，以其寒也，故能除热，小儿疳积一证，皆因湿热闭结所致，蜣螂咸能软坚润下，以其善于攻屎，故能攻肠中坚结之屎，从便而出，则湿热除而疳积愈耳，至于拔箭镞，贴疔疮，敷多骨疽疡，治痔漏虫蚀，皆外治方法，却有效验，亦不过取虫之蠕动善攻，有清热解毒之意已。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-n07ub5j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-n07ub5j"}},{"ID":"20240613175508-ent6bz7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175508-ent6bz7","updated":"20240613175512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175508-nvu6urh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175508-nvu6urh","updated":"20240613175508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸寒，有毒。主治小儿惊痫螈 ，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175508-cg453w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175508-cg453w3","updated":"20240613175508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蜣螂所在有之，有大小二种，小者身黑而暗，不堪入药。大者身黑而光，名胡蜣螂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175508-c1lkyqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175508-c1lkyqx","updated":"20240613175508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹翼下有小黄子，附母而飞，见灯光则来，宜入药用。蜣螂以土包粪，转而成丸，雄曳雌推，置于坝中覆之而去，数日有小蜣螂出，盖孚乳于中也，故一名推丸，又名推车客。深目高鼻，状如羌胡，背负黑甲，状如武士，故一名铁甲将军，昼伏夜出，故又名夜游将军。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175508-z860jis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175508-z860jis","updated":"20240613175508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂甲虫也，出于池泽，以土包转而成生育。气味咸寒，是甲虫而禀水土之气化。甲虫属金，金能制风，故主治小儿惊痫螈 。禀土气，故治腹胀之寒热。禀水气，故治大人癫疾之狂阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175807-49i6c9y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175807-49i6c9y"}},{"ID":"20240613175808-6siqk2a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175808-6siqk2a","updated":"20240613175815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175808-7q8czah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175808-7q8czah","updated":"20240613175808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主小儿惊痫，螈 ，腹胀，寒热，大人癫疾狂易（音羊）。手足端寒，肢满贲豚。一名 （音诘）蜣（音羌）。火熬之良。生长沙池泽。五月五日取，蒸，藏之，临用陶隐居云∶《庄子》云， 蜣之智，在于转丸。其喜入人粪中，取屎丸而却推之，俗名为推丸。当取大者，其类有三、四种，以鼻头扁者为真。唐本注云∶《别录》云，捣为丸，塞下部，引痔虫出尽，永瘥。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶此类多种，取鼻高目深者，名胡蜣螂，今所在皆有之。药性论云∶蜣螂，使，主治小儿疳虫蚀。日华子云∶能堕胎，治疰忤，和干姜敷恶疮，出箭头，其粪窒痔 出虫。入药去足炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175808-zgtgfnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175808-zgtgfnb","updated":"20240613175808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶蜣螂，生长沙池泽，今处处有之。其类极多，取其大者。又鼻高目深者，名胡蜣螂，用之最佳。五月五日取，蒸而藏之，临用当炙，勿置水中，令人吐。小儿疳虫方∶多用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175808-nb26py5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175808-nb26py5","updated":"20240613175808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂心，主疔疮。而《本经》不着。唐·刘禹锡纂《柳州救三死方》云∶元和十一年得疔疮，凡十四日，日益笃，善药敷之皆莫能知，长乐贾方伯教用蜣螂心，一夕而百苦皆已。明年正月食羊肉又大作，再用亦如神验。其法∶一味贴疮，半日许可再易，血尽根出遂愈。蜣螂心，腹下度取之，其肉稍白是也。所以云食羊肉又大作者，盖蜣螂畏羊肉故耳。用时须禁食羊肉。其法盖出葛洪《肘后方》。又主箭镞入骨不可拔者，微熬巴豆与蜣螂并研匀，涂所斯须痛定必微痒，且忍之，待极痒不可忍，便撼动箭镞拔之立出。此方∶传于夏候郓。郓初为阆州录事参军，有人额上有箭痕，问之。云∶随马侍中征田悦中射，马侍中与此药，立可拔镞出，后以生肌膏药敷之，遂无苦，因并方∶获之。云∶诸疮亦可疗。郓得方∶后，至洪州逆旅，主人妻患疮，呻吟方∶极，以此药试之，立愈。又主沙尘入眼不可出者，取生蜣螂一枚陈藏器∶治蜂 。烧死蜣螂末，和醋敷之。圣惠方∶治一切恶疮及沙虱水弩，恶疽，并皆治之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175808-0ucbvs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175808-0ucbvs0","updated":"20240613175808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用蜣螂十枚，端午日收干者佳。杵末油调敷之。外台秘要∶治 疡风。取涂中死蜣螂杵烂之，周回得恶疮，未识别者。取蜣螂杵，绞取汁，敷其上。刘涓子∶治鼠 。死蜣螂作末，苦酒和敷之，数过衍义曰∶蜣螂，大小二种∶一种大者为胡蜣螂，身黑光，腹翼下有小黄，子附母而飞行，尽飞。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-rbq8xdc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-rbq8xdc"}},{"ID":"20240613175447-76zhad5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-76zhad5","updated":"20240613175454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-9mnft3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-9mnft3e","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」推丸，推车客、黑牛儿，铁甲将军、夜游将军。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-6j0vtu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-6j0vtu0","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、寒、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-e1vmnm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-e1vmnm2","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-ghwm67o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-ghwm67o","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、小儿惊风（不拘急、慢均适用）。用蜣螂一枚捣烂，加水一小碗，于百沸汤中烫热，去渣，饮服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-efqsum4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-efqsum4","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿疳疾。用土裹蜣螂煨熟。吃下。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-w45w8el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-w45w8el","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿重舌。有蜣螂烧成末，唾液和匀敷舌上。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-n654zdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-n654zdm","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、赤白痢（包括噤口痢及泄泻）。有蜣螂烧研为末。每用半钱或一钱，烧酒调服，小儿用黄酒调服。立效。此方名“黑牛散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-o7j0iad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-o7j0iad","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、大肠蜕肛。用蜣螂烧存性，研为末，加阔步片研匀，敷肛上托入，即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-ybd403r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-ybd403r","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、大小便不通，用夏天收集、阴干的蜣螂一个，放净砖上，四面以灰火烘干，当腰切断。大便不通，用上截；小便不通。用下截，二便不通，用全部。各研为末，水送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-nah0ige","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-nah0ige","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、小便血淋。用蜣螂研为末，水冲服。“"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-1abme20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-1abme20","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、痔泥土出水。用蜣、螂一个阴干，加冲片少许，研为细末，搓纸捻蘸末塞入孔内，渐渐生肉，药自退出，即愈。又方：用蜣螂焙干，研为末，先以矾汤洗过，再加药末敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-5szyzbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-5szyzbd","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、疔肿恶疮。生取蜣螂一个，在蜜汤中浸死，瓦上焙焦为末。先用针烧过，把疮肿挑破，然后用醋调药末敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175447-v75bk4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175447-v75bk4b","updated":"20240613175447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、无名恶疮。用死蜣螂捣汁敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175359-ooo2uvz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175359-ooo2uvz"}},{"ID":"20240613175400-iva1ggi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-iva1ggi","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：蜣螂"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-z2jbqcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-z2jbqcl","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ytwc99k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ytwc99k","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lmaxjyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lmaxjyt","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ya5oki6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ya5oki6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 推粪虫、推屎爬、屎蛒螂、粪球虫、铁甲将军、牛屎虫、推车虫"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-m7u0gjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-m7u0gjw","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6617fu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6617fu2","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鞘翅目金龟子科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜣螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Catharsius molossus L.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般6～8月间捕捉，捉回后置沸水中烫死，烘干即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lhemq2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lhemq2z","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-dx6xslh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-dx6xslh","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-k4ryaky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-k4ryaky","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-kcddl19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-kcddl19","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒，消肿，通便。用于疮疡肿毒，痔漏，便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-f1d6o5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-f1d6o5v","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-zt0njw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-zt0njw2","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.5～1钱；外用适量，研粉敷，或油调搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-8gp8cet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-8gp8cet","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-alt89z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-alt89z8","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-42hwiog","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-42hwiog","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蜣螂"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-g4iv5au","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-g4iv5au","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-a9jhgni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-a9jhgni","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6i6r839","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6i6r839","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-goxkdcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-goxkdcf","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蛣蜣（《尔雅》），天社（《广雅》），转丸、弄丸（崔豹《古今注》），推丸（陶弘景），胡蜣螂（《蜀本草》），推车客（《本事方》），推屎虫（《孙天仁集效方》），黑牛儿、铁甲将军（李延寿），大乌壳硬虫（《普济方》），夜游将军（《纲目》），屎蜣螂（《本草原始》），滚屎虫、车屎客（《医林纂要》），牛屎虫（《苏州本产药材》），推车虫（《药材资料汇编》），大将军、触角牛（《河北药材》），铁角牛（《山西中药志》），粪球虫（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lf4kjs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lf4kjs9","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-vzshetn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-vzshetn","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-s97tvws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-s97tvws","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-z6mi7x3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-z6mi7x3","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为金龟子科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"屎蛒螂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般于6～8月间晚上利用灯光诱捕，沸水烫死，再用炭火烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-y7430w2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-y7430w2","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-8arjyxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-8arjyxv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分布江苏、浙江、云南及其它大部分地区。主产江苏、浙江、河北、湖北等地。此外，福建、广东、广西亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-5hovdl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-5hovdl7","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-9396e9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-9396e9n","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全体黑色，稍带光泽。雄虫体长3.3～3.8厘米，雌虫略小。雄虫头部前方呈扇面状，表面有鱼鳞状皱纹，中央有一基部大而向上逐渐尖细并略呈方形的角突；其后方之两侧有复眼，复眼间有一光亮无皱纹的狭带。前胸背板密布匀称的小圆突，中部有横形隆脊，隆脊中段微向前曲成钝角状，两侧端各有齿状角突1枚，在齿突前下方有一浅凹，其底部光滑无小圆突，浅凹外侧有一较深的凹，底部小圆突十分模糊或缺如；小盾片不可见；前翅为鞘翅，相当隆起，满布致密皱形刻纹，各方有7条易辨的纵线；后翅膜质，黄色或黄棕色。口部、胸部下方，有很多褐红色或褐黄色纤毛，中后足跗节两侧有成列的褐红色毛刺。雌虫外形与雄虫很相似，惟头部中央不呈角状突而为后面平、前面扁圆形的隆起，顶端呈一横脊；前胸背板横形隆脊近似直线，两侧端不呈齿状突角，且只有外侧的深凹，明显可见。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ko64443","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ko64443","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栖息在牛粪堆、人屎堆中，或在粪堆下掘土穴居。吸食动物之尸体及粪尿等。有夜间扑灯趋光的习性。产卵后，雌雄共同推曳粪土将卵包裹而转成丸状。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-zmzaqbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-zmzaqbm","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ho86x6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ho86x6g","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥虫体呈黑褐色，长3～4厘米，宽1.8～3厘米，雄虫较雌虫稍大。雄虫头部前方呈扇面形，易脱落，中央具角突1支，长约6毫米。前胸背板呈宽半月形，顶部有攒形隆脊，两侧各有角突1枚。后胸约占体长1/2，为翅覆盖。雌者头部中央及前胸背板横形隆脊的两侧无角状突。前翅革质，黑褐色，有7条纵向平行的纹理；后翅膜质，黄色或黄棕色。足3对。体质坚硬，有臭气。以体黑、干燥、完整者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ywc7s4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ywc7s4b","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-4vdkfkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-4vdkfkv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含有毒成分约1％。有效物质能溶于水、乙醇及氯仿，但不溶于乙醚。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-gmfeezp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-gmfeezp","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-1lipsfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-1lipsfv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜣螂毒素。注射于小白鼠后表现不安，数十分钟后因痉挛发作致死；静脉注射于家兔后，血压一时下降，随即上升，呼吸振幅增大，频率加快；对蟾蜍离体心脏有抑制作用，灌注于蟾蜍的后肢血管，有暂时的扩张作用；对家兔肠管及子宫有抑制作用，对蟾蜍的神经肌肉标本有麻痹作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-7wvumcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-7wvumcc","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-dex9fkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-dex9fkq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：\"手、足阳明，足厥阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-e7e92df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-e7e92df","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-luwrfzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-luwrfzr","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-wqaisps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-wqaisps","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-93duw2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-93duw2g","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ghvsr73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ghvsr73","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《汤液本草》：\"气寒，味酸，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-bg08vv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-bg08vv5","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-puj6qu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-puj6qu6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-s6u3l3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-s6u3l3v","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"畏羊角、石膏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-1olwvf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-1olwvf6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药对》：\"畏羊肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-yfx9jfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-yfx9jfm","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《品汇精要》：\"妊娠不可用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-zi57aq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-zi57aq3","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-sq28ohw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-sq28ohw","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 定惊，破瘀，通便，攻毒。治惊痫，癫狂，症瘕，噎膈反胃，腹胀便结，淋病，疳积，血痢，痔漏，疔肿，恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-epc4eoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-epc4eoq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主小儿惊痫瘈疭，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂易。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lopnn3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lopnn3l","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主手足端寒，肢满，奔豚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-e84y2o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-e84y2o3","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治小儿疳虫蚀。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-bbe1rns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-bbe1rns","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"治蜂瘘，烧死蜣螂末和醋敷之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-q7u2be9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-q7u2be9","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"能堕胎，治疰忤；和干姜敷恶疮，出箭头。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-0m8rw5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-0m8rw5t","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草权度》：\"去大肠风热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-bfjwemp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-bfjwemp","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草求原》：\"治小儿积滞，土包烧食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-q4e6ysj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-q4e6ysj","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-kx6yoms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-kx6yoms","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～8分；或入丸、散。外用：研末调敷或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-caulu72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-caulu72","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-iu1wj4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-iu1wj4u","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿惊风，不拘急慢：蜣螂一枚。杵烂，以水一小盏，于百沸汤中烫热，去滓饮之。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-r9bi56d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-r9bi56d","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治膈气吐食：地牛儿二个，推屎虫一公一母。同入罐中，待虫食尽牛儿，以泥裹煨存性，用去白陈皮二钱，以巴豆同炒过，去豆，将陈皮及虫为末，每用一、二分，吹入咽中，吐痰三、四次愈。（《孙天仁集效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-fmwx0i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-fmwx0i8","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治大、小便闭，经月欲死者：推车客七个，土狗七个。新瓦焙，研末，用虎目树南向皮，煎汁调服。（《本事方》推车散）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-fkkyeic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-fkkyeic","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小便血淋：蜣螂研水服。（《鲍氏小儿方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-hvneeab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-hvneeab","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疳：蜣螂裹烧熟，与儿食。（《韩氏医通》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6kwahve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6kwahve","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治赤白痢、噤口痢及泄泻：黑牛儿烧研，每服半钱或一钱，烧酒调服。小儿以黄洒服。（李延寿）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-vx66i6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-vx66i6i","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治痔漏出水：蜣螂一枚。阴干，入冰片少许，为细末，纸捻蘸末入孔内，渐渐生肉，药自退出。（《纲目》）又方：用蜣螂焙干，研为末，先以矾汤洗过，再加药末敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-qk7vpnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-qk7vpnz","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治一切疔疮：地上新粪内泥堆中大乌壳硬虫，活者取来，用蜜浸待死，新瓦上煅灰，用好蜡调敷上。先用针火上烧过，待冷，拨损疮头。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-chqkmxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-chqkmxy","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治鼻中息肉，不闻香臭：蜣螂一十枚。纳青竹筒中，以刀削去竹青，以油单囊筒口，令密，纳厕坑中，四十九日，取出曝干，入麝香少许，同细研为散，涂息肉上。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lo82ow7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lo82ow7","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治小儿重舌：烧蜣螂末和唾敷舌上。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-n35jvcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-n35jvcx","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治大肠脱肛：蜣螂烧存性，为末，入冰片研匀，掺肛上，托之即入。（《医学集成》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-3bainwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-3bainwo","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治附骨疽及鱼眼疮：蜣螂七枚。和大麦面，烂捣封之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-nlhl19t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-nlhl19t","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治疬疡：途中先死蜣螂，捣烂涂之，当揩令热封之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lqskzt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lqskzt3","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治针灸疮血出不止：死蜣螂末猪脂涂之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-tcrip5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-tcrip5g","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂大小便不通：用夏天收集、阴干的蜣螂一个，放净砖上，四面以灰火烘干，当腰切断。大便不通，用上截；小便不通。用下截，二便不通，用全部。各研为末，水送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-7t1fpsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-7t1fpsd","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃无名恶疮：用死蜣螂捣汁敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-s1h2ttd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-s1h2ttd","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-x0jhl5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-x0jhl5d","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗膀胀、尿道结石"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-xl84hmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-xl84hmo","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜣螂去头，置于新瓦上焙干，研成粉末。每次口服1.5～3克，每日2次。临床观察20余例，部分病例可见结石排出。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-7j2vezm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-7j2vezm","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗麻痹性肠梗阻"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-cfiabxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-cfiabxj","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取蜣螂虫7只，黑白丑3钱，石菖蒲3钱。水煎，1日2次早晚分服。服至大便畅通为止。临床试治3例，均愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-v19rotg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-v19rotg","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ltirssj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ltirssj","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"蜣螂，治小儿惊痫瘛疭，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂走，皆肝、胃、大肠三经风热壅盛所致，咸寒除三经之邪热，则诸症自瘳。《别录》主手足端寒、支满者，以脾胃主四肢而治中焦，肺气结滞则血液不能通行灌溉于手足，胃家热壅及大肠结实，则中焦不治而气逆支满，行三焦之壅滞则所苦减除矣。咸能软坚入肾，故又主奔豚也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-97urowq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-97urowq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《长沙药解》：\"蜣螂，善破症瘕，能开燥结，《金匮》鳖甲煎丸用之，治病疟日久结为疟瘕，以其破症而开结也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-rcc7db2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-rcc7db2","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6arjy05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6arjy05","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 现售商品中另有一种独角蜣螂虫，为独角仙科昆虫独角仙的干燥雄虫。全体棕色或棕褐色。头顶有崛起的角状突，长约1.7～3厘米，角上端2回分叉。前胸背板中央亦有一发达的二叉棘状突，长约1厘米，尖端略弯向前下方。质较松脆。产于江苏、安徽、山东、山西等地。一般均自产自销。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-7i9p2yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-7i9p2yj","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-sg1xye4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-sg1xye4","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-9ioew64","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-9ioew64","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蜣螂"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-n7965cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-n7965cp","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-n7p2yvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-n7p2yvy","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ewumms4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ewumms4","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6qp93fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6qp93fq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 天社、转丸、弄丸、推丸、胡蜣螂、推车客、天水牛、推屎虫、黑牛儿、铁甲将军、大乌壳硬虫、夜游将军、屎蜣螂、滚屎虫、车屎客、牛屎虫、推车虫、大将军、触角牛、粪球虫、铁角牛"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-adhceb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-adhceb6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-8zub5h0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-8zub5h0","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" dung beetle"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-gsfo45d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-gsfo45d","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-2rdxmjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-2rdxmjd","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-hm69scv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-hm69scv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《别录》：蜣螂，生长沙池泽。五月取，蒸藏之，临用当炙，匆置水中，令人吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-welsusu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-welsusu","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：《庄子》云：'螂之智，在于转丸。'其喜入人粪中，取屎丸而却推之，俗名为摧丸。当取大者，其类有三、四种，以鼻头扁者为真。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-1rvr49t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-1rvr49t","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草衍义》：蜣螂，大小二种：一种大者胡蜣螂，身黑光，腹翼下有小黄，子附母而飞行。昼不出，夜方飞出，至人家庭户中，见灯光则来。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-imk4e4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-imk4e4j","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ukyikzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ukyikzk","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为金龟子科动物屎壳螂的全虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ezjnttl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ezjnttl","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Catharsius molossus (Linnaeus)"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-oic8lwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-oic8lwl","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：6-8月间晚上利用灯光诱捕，沸水烫死，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-em8a1wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-em8a1wt","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-lkskqi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-lkskqi6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：常栖息于草原和农村中牛、马、驴的粪堆下，掘土穴局面。产卵后雌雄共同推粪土将卵包裹而成丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-2hlp49u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-2hlp49u","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：广泛分布于全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-gsa2r8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-gsa2r8k","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-gzi0nyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-gzi0nyw","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 屎壳螂，全体宽卵圆形，黑色，略有光泽。胸下密被纤长绒毛。雄虫头部前方呈扇面形，表面密被鱼鳞状皱纹，头上有一基部粗大向上收尖的角突。触角4节，前胸背板表面均匀分布细圆疣状刻纹，在中部稍后高高突出成锐形横脊。鞘翅密布细皱纹，各有7条易辨之纵线。足短壮。雌虫头顶无角突，而呈横脊状隆起。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6bq3obc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6bq3obc","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-huw46lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-huw46lk","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，虫体呈椭圆形，长3-4cm，宽1.8-3cm，黑褐色，有光泽。雄虫较雌虫稍大，头部前方呈扇面形，易脱落，中央具角突1支，长约6mm。前胸背板呈宽关月形，顶部有横形隆脊，两侧各有角突1枚，后胸约占体长的1/2，为翅覆盖。雌虫头部中央及前胸背板横形隆脊的两侧无角状突。前翅革质，黑褐色，有7条纵向平行的纹理，后翅膜质，黄色或黄棕色。足3对，体质坚硬。有臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-0au9bxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-0au9bxq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，粉末特征：①体壁碎片浅黄色黄色或深棕黄色，大小不等，形状不一.有的刚毛已脱落，散有毛窝，毛窝附近有星芒状的色素颗粒;有的边缘增厚，密布棘状物，有的着生和三粗刚毛或少数细长刚毛.②刚毛黄色或黄棕色，细长，先端锐尖，表面具疣状突起，长60-20μm，基部直径7-15μm，壁厚1-3μm。③横纹肌纤维众多，近无色或淡黄色，半透明，多数断裂成薄片状，表同有紧密排列的曲折状或水波状的明暗带，纹理较清晰。④碳酸钙结晶众多，形状不规则，大小在2-10.5μm之间。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-gzim8rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-gzim8rj","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-b2gmq03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-b2gmq03","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含有毒成分约1%（蜣螂毒素）；有效成分能溶于水、乙醇及氯仿，但不溶于乙醚。100℃加热,经30min也被破坏。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-2flq3s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-2flq3s6","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-selim4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-selim4s","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.对呼吸作用：蜣螂毒素。注射于小白鼠后表现不安，数十分钟后因痉挛发作致死；静脉注射于家兔后，血压一时下降，随即上升，呼吸振幅增大，频率加快；2.对心脏作用：对蟾蜍离体心脏有抑制作用，灌注于蟾蜍的后肢血管，有暂时的扩张作用；3.对平滑肌作用：对家兔肠管及子宫有抑制作用，对蟾蜍的神经肌肉标本有麻痹作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-uaecvvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-uaecvvq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-m146a9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-m146a9i","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 去杂质，或去足、翅。切制：焙干，研粉既得"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6vpsk3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6vpsk3o","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ush5drl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ush5drl","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别（10取本品粉末1g，加甲醇20ml冷浸过夜，过滤，溶液浓缩至5ml，将浓缩液滴在滤纸上，喷0.5%茚三酮溶液或0.2%吲哚醒丙酮溶液，然后在110℃下烘烤，可见黑色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-yrf2az9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-yrf2az9","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品乙醇提取液2ml，加入三氯化铁试剂1-2滴，溶液呈墨绿色。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-qx3g7jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-qx3g7jv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-xmswaas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-xmswaas","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-tw4qwun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-tw4qwun","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-aacufki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-aacufki","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-byi88q4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-byi88q4","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-fdnmwg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-fdnmwg0","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾胃虚寒者及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-p6n9vmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-p6n9vmx","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-7svzczw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-7svzczw","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破瘀；定惊；通便；散结；拔毒去腐。主症瘕；惊痫；噎膈反胃；腹胀便秘；痔漏；疔肿；恶疮"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-ppn07w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-ppn07w4","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-5ufoho4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-5ufoho4","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-5g；研末，1-2g。外用：研末撒、调敷或捣烂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-vm5a0y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-vm5a0y3","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-a78mzj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-a78mzj0","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿惊风，不拘急慢：蜣螂一枚。杵烂，以水-小盏，于百沸汤中烫热，去滓饮之。(《纲目》)②治膈气吐食： 地牛儿二个，推屎虫一公一母。同入罐中，待虫食尽牛儿，以泥裹煨存性，用去白陈皮二钱，以巴豆同炒过，去豆，将陈皮及虫为末，每用一、二分，吹入咽中，吐痰三、四次愈。(《孙天仁集效方》)③治大、小便闭，经月欲死者： 推车客七个，士狗七个。新瓦焙，研未，用虎目树南向皮，煎汁调服。 (《本事方》推车散)④治小便血淋： 蜣螂研水服。(《鲍氏小儿方》)⑤治疳：蜣螂裹烧熟，与儿食。(《韩氏医通》)⑥治赤白痢、噤口痢及泄泻： 黑牛儿烧研，每服半钱或一钱，烧酒调服。小儿以黄酒服。(李延寿)⑦治痔漏出水： 蜣螂一枚，阴干，入冰片少许，为细末，纸捻蘸末入孔内，渐渐生肉，药自退出。(《纲目》) ⑧治一切疗疮： 地上新粪内泥堆中大乌壳硬虫， 活者取来，用蜜浸待死，新瓦上煅灰，用好醋调敷上。先用针火上烧过，待冷，拨损疮头。 (《普济方》)⑨治鼻中息肉，不闻香臭： 蜣螂一十枚。纳青竹筒中，以刀削去竹青，以油单裹筒口，令密，纳厕坑中，四十九日，取出曝干，入麝香少许，同细研为散，涂痛肉上。 《圣惠方》⑩治小儿重舌:烧蜣螂末和唾敷舌上。(《子母秘录》)(11)治大肠脱肛：烧蜣螂存性，为末，入冰片研匀，掺肛上，托之即入。(《医学集成》)(12)治附骨疽及鱼眼疮： 烧娜七枚。和大麦面，烂捣封之。(〈圣惠方＞(13)治疠疡： 途中先死蜣螂，捣烂涂之，当揩令热封之。(〈千金方》＞(14)治针灸疮血出不止： 死蜣螂末猪脂涂之。 (《千金方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-kmgh1l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-kmgh1l5","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-37o9wvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-37o9wvl","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗膀胱、尿道结石：蜣螂法头；置于新瓦上焙干，研成粉末。每次口服1.5-3g，每日2次。临床观察20余例，部分病例可见结石排出。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-x5tdv2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-x5tdv2a","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗麻痹性肠梗阻：取蜣螂7只；黑白丑3钱,石菖蒲3钱。水煎，1日2次早晚分服。至大便畅通为止。临床试治3例，均愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-qllgehr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-qllgehr","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-yp66qkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-yp66qkp","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主小儿惊痫，腹胀寒热，大人癫疾狂易。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-hk91wd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-hk91wd7","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：主手足端寒，肢满，奔豚。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-sbdy75l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-sbdy75l","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：治小儿疳虫蚀。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-zswb3fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-zswb3fi","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草拾遗》：治蜂瘘，烧死蜣螂末和醋敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-zs18sjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-zs18sjd","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：能堕胎，和干姜敷恶疮，出箭头。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-3fe3lyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-3fe3lyq","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草权度》：去大肠风热。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-38dmxsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-38dmxsn","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草求原》：治小儿积滞，土包烧食。"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-6gwjz8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-6gwjz8u","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613175400-z6zhncv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175400-z6zhncv","updated":"20240613175400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613175402-dew1mm1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613175402-dew1mm1"}},{"ID":"20240613175403-bv10zzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613175403-bv10zzx"}}]}